ome & Living > Lighting', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81z1k-mid8lcpsvg8y2f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F718558431%2F20597415699', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
